A region holds statements: #note.
#aside!

#let tally = 0
#let last = 0
#for (const k of Array.of(1, 2, 3)) [
  #let tally = tally + k
  #{ last = tally }
]
Each pass starts from the outer tally (#tally): the last pass made #last.
